{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":13,"lesson_key":"S2L13","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Nida 'Yaa' aur 'Yaa Ayyuha': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Nida 'Yaa' aur 'Yaa Ayyuha': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","en":"Vocative Particles 'Yaa' & 'Yaa Ayyuha' (O!): آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","ur":"حرفِ ندا 'يَا' اور 'يَا أَيُّهَا': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-निदा 'या' और 'या अय्युहा': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ"},"arabic_Focus":"آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","hinglish_Focus":"Adam, Log → Aye Adam!, Aye logo!","page_numbers":"74","book_page":74,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","hinglish":"Adam, Log → Aye Adam!, Aye logo!","arabic_word":"آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ","arabic_combined":"آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","hinglish_word":"Adam, Log","hinglish_combined":"Adam, Log → Aye Adam!, Aye logo!","title_en":"Harf-e-Nida 'Yaa' aur 'Yaa Ayyuha': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 13 (Book Page 74)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ","after_ar":"يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","before_hi":"Adam, Log","after_hi":"Aye Adam!, Aye logo!"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L13 — Harf-e-Nida 'Yaa' aur 'Yaa Ayyuha': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L13 — Harf-e-Nida 'Yaa' aur 'Yaa Ayyuha': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["يَا + Naam (Ek Pesh ـُ)","يَا آدَمُ / يَا مُوسَىٰ / يَا مَرْيَمُ / يَا نُوحُ","Aye Adam! / Aye Musa! / Aye Maryam! / Aye Nuh!"],["يَا أَيُّهَا + الْـ (Muzakkar)","يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ / يَا أَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ / يَا أَيُّهَا الْمُزَّمِّلُ","Aye logo! / Aye Nabi! / Aye kapda lapetne wale!"],["يَا أَيَّتُهَا + الْـ (Mu'annas)","يَا أَيَّتُهَا النَّفْسُ الْمُطْمَئِنَّةُ","Aye itminan paane wali jaan!"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 13</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Nida 'Yaa' aur 'Yaa Ayyuha': آدَمُ ← يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ (Page 74)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Nida (يَا / يَا أَيُّهَا)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• آدَمُ ، النَّاسُ (Adam, Log) se يَا آدَمُ ، يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ (Aye Adam!, Aye logo!) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 74):** Kisi ko pukarne (*Nida*) ke liye **`يَا`** ('Aye!') lagaya jata hai aur pukare gaye naam par Tanween ke bajaye **ek Pesh (`ـُ`)** aata hai (`يَا آدَمُ`، `يَا شُعَيْبُ`). Aur agar lafz ke shuru mein `الْـ` ho toh `يَا` ke saath **`أَيُّهَا`** (muzakkar ke liye) ya **`أَيَّتُهَا`** (mu'annas ke liye) lagaya jata hai: `يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ` (Aye logo!)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_lbl2","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Pehli do misaalon ke alfaaz insaani naam hain. Doosre column mein un naamon se pehle (يَا) laga kar pukara gaya hai. Arabi mein (يَا) kisi ko pukaarne ya nida dene ke liye istemal hota hai, jiska tarjuma 'Ae' kiya jata hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_r5","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Darj zail aasan Qur'ani alfaaz o tarakeeb ko khud samajh kar tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_g6","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l13_g6_w1","arabic":"يَا شُعَيْبُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شُعَيْبُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Shoaib!","translations":{"en":"O Shu'ayb!","ur":"اے شعیب!","hi":"ऐ शुऐब!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w2","arabic":"يَا إِبْرَاهِيمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Ibrahim!","translations":{"en":"O Abraham!","ur":"اے ابراہیم!","hi":"ऐ इब्राहीम!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w3","arabic":"يَا دَاوُودُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دَاوُودُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Dawood!","translations":{"en":"O David!","ur":"اے داؤد!","hi":"ऐ दाऊद!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w4","arabic":"يَا آدَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">آدَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Adam!","translations":{"en":"O Adam!","ur":"اے آدم!","hi":"ऐ आदम!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w5","arabic":"يَا مُوسَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُوسَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Moosa!","translations":{"en":"O Moses!","ur":"اے موسیٰ!","hi":"ऐ मूसा!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w6","arabic":"يَا عِيسَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِيسَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Eesa!","translations":{"en":"O Jesus!","ur":"اے عیسیٰ!","hi":"ऐ ईसा!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w7","arabic":"يَا صَالِحُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صَالِحُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Saleh!","translations":{"en":"O Salih!","ur":"اے صالح!","hi":"ऐ सालेह!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w8","arabic":"يَا مَرْيَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرْيَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Maryam!","translations":{"en":"O Mary!","ur":"اے مریم!","hi":"ऐ मरियम!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w9","arabic":"يَا يَحْيَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَحْيَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Yahya!","translations":{"en":"O John / Yahya!","ur":"اے یحییٰ!","hi":"ऐ यह्या!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w10","arabic":"يَا فِرْعَوْنُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِرْعَوْنُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Fir'aun!","translations":{"en":"O Pharaoh!","ur":"اے فرعون!","hi":"ऐ फ़िरौन!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w11","arabic":"يَا هُودُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُودُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Hood!","translations":{"en":"O Hud!","ur":"اے ہود!","hi":"ऐ हूद!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w12","arabic":"يَا نُوحُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نُوحُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Nooh!","translations":{"en":"O Noah!","ur":"اے نوح!","hi":"ऐ नूह!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w13","arabic":"يَا هَارُونُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هَارُونُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Haroon!","translations":{"en":"O Aaron!","ur":"اے ہارون!","hi":"ऐ हारून!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w14","arabic":"يَا إِبْلِيسُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْلِيسُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Iblees!","translations":{"en":"O Iblees!","ur":"اے ابلیس!","hi":"ऐ इब्लीस!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w15","arabic":"يَا زَكَرِيَّا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">زَكَرِيَّا</span>","hinglish":"Ae Zakariya!","translations":{"en":"O Zechariah!","ur":"اے زکریا!","hi":"ऐ ज़करिया!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w16","arabic":"يَا لُوطُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لُوطُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Loot!","translations":{"en":"O Lot!","ur":"اے لوط!","hi":"ऐ लूत!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w17","arabic":"يَا أَرْضُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَرْضُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae zameen!","translations":{"en":"O earth!","ur":"اے زمین!","hi":"ऐ ज़मीन!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w18","arabic":"يَا مَالِكُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَالِكُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Malik!","translations":{"en":"O Malik!","ur":"اے مالک!","hi":"ऐ मालिक!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w19","arabic":"يَا هَامَانُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هَامَانُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Haman!","translations":{"en":"O Haman!","ur":"اے ہامان!","hi":"ऐ हामान!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w20","arabic":"يَا سَامِرِيُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَامِرِيُّ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Samiri!","translations":{"en":"O Samiri!","ur":"اے سامری!","hi":"ऐ सामरी!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w21","arabic":"يَا جِبَالُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جِبَالُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae pahadon!","translations":{"en":"O mountains!","ur":"اے پہاڑو!","hi":"ऐ पहाड़ो!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w22","arabic":"يَا نَارُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَارُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae aag!","translations":{"en":"O fire!","ur":"اے آگ!","hi":"ऐ आग!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g6_w23","arabic":"يَا سَمَاءُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَمَاءُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae aasman!","translations":{"en":"O sky!","ur":"اے آسمان!","hi":"ऐ आसमान!"}}],"cols":4}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_r7","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Agar kisi lafz ke shuru mein (الْـ) ho, toh usse pehle (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيَّتُهَا) lagaya jata hai, jaise teesri misaal mein wazeh hai. (يَا) aur (أَيُّهَا) dono ka ma'ana ek hi hai. Ab aap darj zail Qur'ani tarakeeb jin mein (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيُّهَا) aaya hai, khud samajh kar tarjuma kar sakte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_g8","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l13_g8_w1","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّاسُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae logon!","translations":{"en":"O people!","ur":"اے لوگو!","hi":"ऐ लोगो!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w2","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا الْإِنسَانُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنسَانُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae insan!","translations":{"en":"O human being / man!","ur":"اے انسان!","hi":"ऐ इंसान!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w3","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّبِيُّ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Nabi!","translations":{"en":"O Prophet!","ur":"اے نبی!","hi":"ऐ नबी!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w4","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا الرَّسُولُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّسُولُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Rasool!","translations":{"en":"O Messenger!","ur":"اے رسول!","hi":"ऐ रसूल!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w5","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا الْعَزِيزُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَزِيزُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae Azeez!","translations":{"en":"O eminent one (noble chief)!","ur":"اے عزیز (مصر)!","hi":"ऐ अज़ीज़!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w6","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا الْمُدَّثِّرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُدَّثِّرُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae kapda odhne wale!","translations":{"en":"O you who covers himself [with a garment]!","ur":"اے کپڑا اوڑھنے والے!","hi":"ऐ कपड़ा ओढ़ने वाले!"},"ref":"74:1"},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w7","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا الْمُزَّمِّلُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُزَّمِّلُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae kamli wale!","translations":{"en":"O you wrapped in garments!","ur":"اے کملی والے!","hi":"ऐ कमली वाले!"},"ref":"73:1"},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w8","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا السَّاحِرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاحِرُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae jadoogar!","translations":{"en":"O magician / sorcerer!","ur":"اے جادوگر!","hi":"ऐ जादूगर!"},"ref":"43:49"},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w9","arabic":"أَيُّهَا الصِّدِّيقُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الصِّدِّيقُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae sacche!","translations":{"en":"O truthful one!","ur":"اے سچے انسان!","hi":"ऐ सच्चे इंसान!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w10","arabic":"أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّاسُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae logon!","translations":{"en":"O people!","ur":"اے لوگو!","hi":"ऐ लोगो!"}},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w11","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا النَّمْلُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّمْلُ</span>","hinglish":"Ae cheentiyon!","translations":{"en":"O ants!","ur":"اے چیونٹیو!","hi":"ऐ चींटियो!"},"ref":"27:18"},{"id":"s2l13_g8_w12","arabic":"يَا أَيُّهَا الْكَافِرُونَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكَافِرُونَ</span>","hinglish":"Ae kafiron!","translations":{"en":"O disbelievers!","ur":"اے کافرو!","hi":"ऐ काफ़िरो!"},"ref":"109:1"}],"cols":4}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_lbl9","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise — Q-1: Darj zail Qur'ani aayat mein us hissay ki nishandehi karein jahan (يَا) ya (يَا أَيُّهَا) ke zariye kisi ko pukara gaya hai:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l13_v10","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l13_v10_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"﴿يَا أَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ حَسْبُكَ اللهُ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّبِيُّ حَسْبُكَ اللهُ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae Nabi! Aap ke liye Allah kafi hai","translations":{"en":"O Prophet, sufficient for you is Allah","ur":"اے نبی! آپ کے لیے اللہ کافی ہے","hi":"ऐ नबी! आपके लिए अल्लाह काफ़ी है"},"ref":"8:64"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"﴿يَا آدَمُ أَنبِئْهُمْ بِأَسْمَائِهِمْ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">آدَمُ أَنبِئْهُمْ بِأَسْمَائِهِمْ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae Adam! Unhein unke naam bata do","translations":{"en":"O Adam, inform them of their names","ur":"اے آدم! انہیں ان کے نام بتا دو","hi":"ऐ आदम! उन्हें उनके नाम बता दो"},"ref":"2:33"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"﴿يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ اعْبُدُوا...﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّاسُ اعْبُدُوا...</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae logon! Ibadat karo...","translations":{"en":"O mankind, worship [your Lord]...","ur":"اے لوگو! عبادت کرو...","hi":"ऐ लोगो! इबादत करो..."},"ref":"2:21"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"﴿يَا أَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ اتَّقِ اللهَ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّبِيُّ اتَّقِ اللهَ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae Nabi! Allah se daro","translations":{"en":"O Prophet, fear Allah","ur":"اے نبی! اللہ سے ڈرو","hi":"ऐ नबी! अल्लाह से डरो"},"ref":"33:1"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"﴿يَا إِبْلِيسُ مَا مَنَعَكَ أَنْ تَسْجُدَ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْلِيسُ مَا مَنَعَكَ أَنْ تَسْجُدَ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae Iblees! Kis cheez ne tujhe rok diya ke tu sajdah kare","translations":{"en":"O Iblees, what prevented you from prostrating?","ur":"اے ابلیس! کس چیز نے تجھے سجدہ کرنے سے روکا؟","hi":"ऐ इब्लीस! किस चीज़ ने तुझे सजदा करने से रोका?"},"ref":"38:75"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"﴿يَا عِيسَىٰ إِنِّي مُتَوَفِّيكَ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِيسَىٰ إِنِّي مُتَوَفِّيكَ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae Eesa! Beshak main aap ko poora lene wala hoon","translations":{"en":"O Jesus, indeed I will take you","ur":"اے عیسیٰ! بیشک میں آپ کو پورا لینے والا ہوں","hi":"ऐ ईसा! बेशक मैं आपको पूरा लेने वाला हूँ"},"ref":"3:55"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"﴿يَا نَارُ كُونِي بَرْدًا وَسَلَامًا﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَارُ كُونِي بَرْدًا وَسَلَامًا</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae aag! Tu thandi aur salamati wali ho ja","translations":{"en":"O fire, be coolness and safety","ur":"اے آگ! تو ٹھنڈی اور سلامتی والی ہو جا","hi":"ऐ आग! तू ठंडी और सलामती वाली हो जा"},"ref":"21:69"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"﴿يَا صَالِحُ ائْتِنَا بِمَا تَعِدُنَا﴾","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">﴿يَا صَالِحُ ائْتِنَا بِمَا تَعِدُنَا﴾</span>","hinglish":"Ae Saleh! Hum par le aao jiska tum wada karte ho","translations":{"en":"O Salih, bring us that which you promise us","ur":"اے صالح! ہم پر لے آؤ جس کا تم وعدہ کرتے ہو","hi":"ऐ सालेह! हम पर ले आओ जिसका तुम वादा करते हो"},"ref":"7:77"},{"id":"s2l13_v10_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"﴿يَا أَيُّهَا السَّاحِرُ ادْعُ لَنَا﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">يَا أَيُّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاحِرُ ادْعُ لَنَا</span>﴾","hinglish":"Ae jadoogar! Hamare liye dua karo","translations":{"en":"O magician, supplicate for us","ur":"اے جادوگر! ہمارے لیے دعا کرو","hi":"ऐ जादूगर! हमारे लिए दुआ करो"},"ref":"43:49"}],"cols":3}}]}}